The arrival must be after the departure as an instant: 10:00-05:00 is 15:00 UTC and 14:00+01:00 is 13:00 UTC, so the arrival is too early although its clock time is later.
-- args --
wellness
jet-lag
add
--from
New York, USA
--to
Frankfurt, Germany
--depart
2026-11-02T10:00-05:00
--arrive
2026-11-02T14:00+01:00
