Usage: gccli wellness jet-lag add --from=PLACE --to=PLACE --depart=TIME --arrive=TIME [flags]

Add a jet lag trip of a flight and an optional return flight.

Flags:
  -h, --help                  Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                  Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                 Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header                Print the column names as the first line of
                              --plain output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"          Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING        Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"          Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                              elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                              auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                              statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version               Print version information.

      --from=PLACE            Place of departure, such as "Frankfurt, Germany".
      --to=PLACE              Place of arrival, such as "New York, USA".
      --depart=TIME           Local departure time with the UTC offset of
                              --from, such as 2026-11-02T10:00+01:00.
      --arrive=TIME           Local arrival time with the UTC offset of --to,
                              such as 2026-11-02T13:00-05:00.
      --return-depart=TIME    Local departure time of the return flight from
                              --to, with its UTC offset.
      --return-arrive=TIME    Local arrival time of the return flight at --from,
                              with its UTC offset.

